11-17-36:
With their clothes rentThe Hebrews rent their clothes at times of mourning (Job
1:20), and also of great shock or distress (Gen. 37:29; 1 Sam. 4:12; 2 Sam. 13:19; 15:32;
2 Chron. 34:27; Ezra 9:3; Jer. 36:24).

11-18-21:
The Holy One of IsraelThis is a favorite phrase with Isaiah. He uses it 27 times
in his book. It appears only five times in the rest of the Bible (Ps. 71:22; 78:41; 89:18;
Jer. 50:29; 51:5).
